---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy — VibeStats" description="How the VibeStats website handles data.">
  <main class="docs-content max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      VibeStats does not ask for an account, set advertising cookies, or receive your coding-session
      data.
    </p>
    <p>
      Dashboard pages load the public aggregate file that a VibeStats user publishes in their GitHub
      profile repository. The site stores only your light or dark theme preference in your browser.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cloudflare hosts the site and GitHub serves repository data, so requests to those services are
      subject to their respective privacy practices.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
